! Gravity static preload module
! This establishes the stress-stiffened initial state shared by modal and transient analyses.
/SOLU
ANTYPE,STATIC
ACEL,{{ gravity_accel_x }},{{ gravity_accel_y }},{{ gravity_accel_z }}
TIME,{{ gravity_time }}
NSUBST,{{ gravity_substeps }}
OUTRES,ALL,ALL
SSTIF,ON
PSTRES,ON
ALLS
SOLVE
FINISH
